  "details": "In multiple maps there are recommended settings for a better experience, these take time to be changed by the local user and are usually map specific and can become annoying if going into a map exploring spree. \n\nMy suggestion is to create a new component or Udon utility to allow map makers to create a \"Settings Pedestal\" that would apply defined settings to the client. These could be temporal and only last in said map to avoid abuse and to preserve the users settings. \n\nThis could also be a nice way for maps to share recommended settings to new users!",
